{
  "name": "Multi-Step Form Workflow with Approval",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "form-submission",
        "responseMode": "responseNode",
        "options": {}
      },
      "name": "Form Submission Webhook",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [250, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "functionCode": "const data = $input.first().json.body;\nconst errors = [];\n\nif (!data.employee_name || data.employee_name.trim().length < 2) {\n  errors.push('Employee name is required (min 2 characters)');\n}\nif (!data.department) {\n  errors.push('Department is required');\n}\nif (!data.request_type) {\n  errors.push('Request type is required');\n}\nif (!data.amount || isNaN(parseFloat(data.amount)) || parseFloat(data.amount) <= 0) {\n  errors.push('Valid amount is required');\n}\nif (!data.justification || data.justification.trim().length < 10) {\n  errors.push('Justification must be at least 10 characters');\n}\n\nconst submissionId = `SUB-${Date.now().toString(36).toUpperCase()}`;\n\nreturn [{\n  json: {\n    submission_id: submissionId,\n    is_valid: errors.length === 0,\n    validation_errors: errors,\n    employee_name: data.employee_name || '',\n    employee_email: data.employee_email || '',\n    department: data.department || '',\n    request_type: data.request_type || '',\n    amount: parseFloat(data.amount) || 0,\n    justification: data.justification || '',\n    submitted_at: new Date().toISOString()\n  }\n}];"
      },
      "name": "Validate Form Data",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [500, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "boolean": [
            {
              "value1": "={{ $json.is_valid }}",
              "value2": true
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "name": "Validation Passed?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [750, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "respondWith": "json",
        "responseBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ status: 'error', errors: $json.validation_errors }) }}",
        "options": {
          "responseCode": 400
        }
      },
      "name": "Return Validation Errors",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [1000, 500]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "number": [
            {
              "value1": "={{ $json.amount }}",
              "operation": "largerEqual",
              "value2": 5000000
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "name": "Requires Manager Approval?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [1000, 200]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "fromEmail": "workflow@company.com",
        "toEmail": "manager@company.com",
        "subject": "🔔 Approval Required: {{ $json.request_type }} - {{ $json.submission_id }}",
        "text": "Approval Required\n\n📋 Submission ID: {{ $json.submission_id }}\n👤 Employee: {{ $json.employee_name }}\n🏢 Department: {{ $json.department }}\n📦 Type: {{ $json.request_type }}\n💰 Amount: Rp {{ $json.amount.toLocaleString() }}\n\nJustification:\n{{ $json.justification }}\n\nClick to approve: {{ $env.BASE_URL }}/webhook/approve/{{ $json.submission_id }}\nClick to reject: {{ $env.BASE_URL }}/webhook/reject/{{ $json.submission_id }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "name": "Send Manager Approval Email",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.emailSend",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [1250, 100],
      "credentials": {
        "smtp": {
          "id": "",
          "name": ""
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "GET",
        "path": "approve/{{ $json.submission_id }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "name": "Approval Webhook",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [1500, 50]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "GET",
        "path": "reject/{{ $json.submission_id }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "name": "Rejection Webhook",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [1500, 200]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "list",
          "value": ""
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "list",
          "value": "Approved_Requests"
        },
        "columns": {
          "mappingMode": "defineBelow",
          "value": {
            "submission_id": "={{ $json.submission_id }}",
            "employee_name": "={{ $json.employee_name }}",
            "department": "={{ $json.department }}",
            "request_type": "={{ $json.request_type }}",
            "amount": "={{ $json.amount }}",
            "status": "APPROVED",
            "approved_at": "={{ $now.toISO() }}"
          },
          "matchingColumns": []
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "name": "Process Approved Request",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4,
      "position": [1750, 50],
      "credentials": {
        "googleSheetsOAuth2Api": {
          "id": "",
          "name": ""
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "fromEmail": "workflow@company.com",
        "toEmail": "={{ $json.employee_email }}",
        "subject": "❌ Request Rejected: {{ $json.submission_id }}",
        "text": "Your request has been rejected.\n\n📋 Submission ID: {{ $json.submission_id }}\n📦 Type: {{ $json.request_type }}\n💰 Amount: Rp {{ $json.amount.toLocaleString() }}\n\nPlease contact your manager for details.",
        "options": {}
      },
      "name": "Notify Submitter Rejected",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.emailSend",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [1750, 200],
      "credentials": {
        "smtp": {
          "id": "",
          "name": ""
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "values": {
          "string": [
            {
              "name": "status",
              "value": "AUTO_APPROVED"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "name": "Auto-Approve Low Amount",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [1250, 350]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "list",
          "value": ""
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "list",
          "value": "Approved_Requests"
        },
        "columns": {
          "mappingMode": "defineBelow",
          "value": {
            "submission_id": "={{ $json.submission_id }}",
            "employee_name": "={{ $json.employee_name }}",
            "department": "={{ $json.department }}",
            "request_type": "={{ $json.request_type }}",
            "amount": "={{ $json.amount }}",
            "status": "AUTO_APPROVED",
            "approved_at": "={{ $now.toISO() }}"
          },
          "matchingColumns": []
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "name": "Save Auto-Approved",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4,
      "position": [1500, 350],
      "credentials": {
        "googleSheetsOAuth2Api": {
          "id": "",
          "name": ""
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "respondWith": "json",
        "responseBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ status: 'ok', submission_id: $json.submission_id, approval_status: $json.amount >= 5000000 ? 'pending_manager' : 'auto_approved' }) }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "name": "Respond Success",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [1750, 400]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Multi-Step Form Workflow with Approval\n\nForm submission → validation → conditional approval routing.\n\n**Flow:**\n1. Receive form submission via webhook\n2. Validate all required fields\n3. If invalid → return errors (400)\n4. If amount ≥ Rp 5,000,000 → send to manager for approval\n5. If amount < Rp 5,000,000 → auto-approve\n6. Manager clicks approve/reject link in email\n7. Approved → process and save\n8. Rejected → notify submitter\n\n**Required Fields:**\n- employee_name, employee_email, department\n- request_type, amount, justification\n\n**Approval Threshold:** Rp 5,000,000",
        "width": 440,
        "height": 360
      },
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [50, 50]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Form Submission Webhook": {
      "main": [
        [{ "node": "Validate Form Data", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]
      ]
    },
    "Validate Form Data": {
      "main": [
        [{ "node": "Validation Passed?", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]
      ]
    },
    "Validation Passed?": {
      "main": [
        [{ "node": "Requires Manager Approval?", "type": "main", "index": 0 }],
        [{ "node": "Return Validation Errors", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]
      ]
    },
    "Requires Manager Approval?": {
      "main": [
        [{ "node": "Send Manager Approval Email", "type": "main", "index": 0 }],
        [{ "node": "Auto-Approve Low Amount", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]
      ]
    },
    "Send Manager Approval Email": {
      "main": [
        [{ "node": "Respond Success", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]
      ]
    },
    "Approval Webhook": {
      "main": [
        [{ "node": "Process Approved Request", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]
      ]
    },
    "Rejection Webhook": {
      "main": [
        [{ "node": "Notify Submitter Rejected", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]
      ]
    },
    "Auto-Approve Low Amount": {
      "main": [
        [{ "node": "Save Auto-Approved", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]
      ]
    },
    "Save Auto-Approved": {
      "main": [
        [{ "node": "Respond Success", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]
      ]
    }
  }
}